= The Escalator

A real-estate developer and television star descends a golden escalator to announce his candidacy for the Republican nomination, opening with a harsh attack on immigrants. Commentators call it a joke. The Republican field is crowded. His numbers are not a joke.

- @ignore: Treat it as a sideshow.
- @engage: Take it seriously. Start building a contrast.
- @amplify: Quietly hope he wins the nomination.

@ignore
subtitle: Safer in the short run.
on-arrival: maga += 2; stability -= 1

We assume the primary electorate will sort it out. It does not.

@engage
subtitle: Early preparation.
on-arrival: funds -= 1 if funds > 0; media_trust += 1; stability += 2

Researchers and rapid-response staff are hired early. The files are thick by the fall.

@amplify
subtitle: A gamble that has side effects.
on-arrival: maga += 5; stability -= 3; far_right += 2; pop_mod += 0.1

Some strategists decide he is the easiest opponent. The risk to the system is not their department.
